d. Description of Recipients (eligibility considerations)
There are no eligibility requirements for Family Support programs. Children participating in permanency planning can meet the following qualifications:
- at imminent risk of entering DSS custody or placement responsibility;
- in agency custody/placement responsibility for less than 12 months;
- in agency custody/placement responsibility for more than 12 months and for whom the plan is NEITHER long-term foster care NOR reunification with birth parents; OR
